KG42.register("clusters-a4ed377bc113a7b5e24190af",{"id":"26-battery_flexibility::v142-d-CL004","paper":"26-battery_flexibility","label":"Pool Hub shared battery pricing, compensation, and cost-minimizing scheduling","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL004","label":"Pool Hub shared battery pricing, compensation, and cost-minimizing scheduling","market_meaning":"Under the design conditions that the shared battery is open to households and the charging source is limited to community renewable generation, storage prices and charging/discharging revenues and expenditures enter the community allocation objective, and the aggregate storage state connects intertemporal operation. This candidate assembles access, pricing, payment, and scheduling interfaces, but the price indices, physical boundaries, and source constraints are not yet closed.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M02"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation","pricing","clearing","settlement"],"scope_disposition":"unresolved","scope_explanation":"All chains are within the M02 shared battery scope, and private battery states and constants do not participate in identity merging. An unresolved index discrepancy exists between the per-household discharge price in R012/R014 and the time-step-only discharge price in the R008 objective; the common applicable interval of the price ordering and composition relation still needs to be checked.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"Storage prices directly connect charging/discharging revenues and expenditures with the allocation objective, and the aggregate storage state restricts feasible operation, so this is assembled across pricing, settlement, and clearing. R010 shares only the consumer power withdrawal permission; P2P permission is primarily attributed to CL003, and permissions or shared nodes cannot replace missing operational constraints.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R008","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the community cost objective, aggregate state, and not yet fully formalized physical limitations of the shared battery."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R012","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the relationship between local and storage prices, connecting storage charging and scheduling coefficients; the different representations of the per-household discharge price remain visible."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R014","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provides the scope of charging compensation, discharge charges, and trading revenues and expenditures, and connects the monetary terms in the community objective."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R010","ownership":"shared","role":"interface","rationale":"Only shares the power withdrawal permission that the shared battery opens to consumers; participation permission is primarily attributed to CL003, and no scheduling condition is added on that basis."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO015","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R010","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::x::x_D","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C004"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e02","v141-b-g02-e15"],"rationale":"The shared battery being open to consumers is complementary to the operational scope aggregating each household's charging and discharging; this mapping identifies the service target and does not add access constraints or quantities."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO016","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R012","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R014","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T002","v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T003","v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T004","v141-c-R012::phi::v141-c-R012-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T003","v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T002","v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T001","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E08"],"rationale":"The price definitions, household indices, and time-step indices of the two chains are consistent, connecting pricing and discharge charges; repeated price composition formulas are not counted as another independent pricing rule and are not equivalent to a payment amount formula."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO017","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R014","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C002","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e22","v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e17"],"rationale":"The source explicitly extends the Pool Hub objective with discharge costs and charging compensation, supporting the assembly of the payment function and the clearing objective; the discharge price index conflict remains, and coefficients are not replaced in the interface."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO018","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R012","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"quantity_interface","from_refs":["v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T001","v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::theta::theta_p_G","v141-c-R008::theta::theta_p_C"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e05","v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e17"],"rationale":"The grid price and charging compensation price of the same mechanism are used respectively in the price relation and the objective coefficient, and their time-step indices match the use definitions; the discharge price inconsistency is not eliminated along with them."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CO019","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R012","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::theta::theta_p_D"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E08"],"rationale":"Both places mean the shared battery discharge price, but the per-household price and the time-step-only printed representation in Eq. (11) differ; for now they are associated as alternative representations of the same kind pending clarification, and interchangeability is not asserted."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM013","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R008::V::settlement.payment","v141-c-R014::V::settlement.payment"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R014::V::settlement.payment","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e22","v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e17"],"rationale":"Both reference the M02 payment function, used respectively to describe charges and the objective interface; unified display does not mean that the individual payments or prices are the same."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM014","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R008::theta::theta_p_G","v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T001"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e05","v141-b-g02-e14"],"rationale":"All are the M02 time-step grid purchase price, retaining their local roles in the objective coefficient and the price ordering."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM015","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R008::theta::theta_p_C","v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T004","v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T001"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e17"],"rationale":"All three are the time-step charging compensation price of the same shared battery; the objective, pricing, and payment roles are retained separately, and no wholesale price equation is added."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM016","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T002","v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T003"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g02-e18"],"rationale":"All are the M02 per-household, per-time-step P2P price and are used in the same discharge price composition relation; the parameter objects of each chain remain independent."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM017","kind":"same_quantity","member_refs":["v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T003","v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T002"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E08"],"rationale":"Both places use the per-household, per-time-step shared battery discharge price, with consistent definitions and indices; the R008 time-step-only object is not added to this identity determination."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM018","kind":"alternative_representation","member_refs":["v141-c-R008::theta::theta_p_D","v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T003","v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T002"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E08"],"rationale":"The index inconsistency of the discharge price between the objective and the price scheme has not yet been explained; all original theta items are visible, and one cannot be chosen to rewrite the other."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM019","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g03-E11"],"rationale":"The two items use the same Eq. (11) objective verbatim in the same Pool Hub applicable domain, so displaying it once suffices; the C001 payment interface and all original bindings are still retained, and the index gap is not thereby resolved."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-OM020","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R012::phi::v141-c-R012-C003","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C003"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e17"],"rationale":"Both formulas express the same per-household discharge price composition relation; R014 additionally has the meaning of a charging obligation, so the complete objects and different functional bindings are retained and are not merged into a payment amount constraint."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-G011","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"Eq. (11) uses p_D^{(t)}, whereas the price and settlement chains use p_D^{(t,h)}. It is not stated whether omitting the household index is a typesetting simplification, a uniform-price assumption, or another treatment, so an unconditional quantity connection from pricing to the objective cannot be completed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R008","v141-c-R012","v141-c-R014"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R008::theta::theta_p_D","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002","v141-c-R012::theta::v141-c-R012-T003","v141-c-R014::theta::v141-c-R014-T002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E08"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Check the discharge price index in the source formula and implementation, and have the upstream clarify the applicable manner; until then keep the two classes of representation and do not replace Eq. (11)."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G012","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The central battery's reference to Eqs. (7)–(9) does not clarify whether the rate limit applies to per-household flow or total flow, nor does it fully give the central state boundaries, initial state, terminal handling, and variable domains. Nominal device data cannot directly determine all model parameters and per-time-step unit conversions.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R008"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C003","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C004","v141-c-R008::x::x_C","v141-c-R008::x::x_D","v141-c-R008::x::x_S","v141-c-R008::theta::theta_alpha","v141-c-R008::theta::theta_beta","v141-c-R008::theta::theta_eta_c","v141-c-R008::theta::theta_eta_d"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e15","v141-b-g03-E09"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Obtain the exact scope of the M02 central battery boundary and rate constraints, initial and terminal state handling, parameter definitions, and units; do not directly apply the private battery form or allocate one-way efficiency from round-trip efficiency."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G013","category":"upstream_missing","description":"R008 delivers only the objective and storage constraints and lacks the mathematical implementation of M02 supply-demand balance, P2P flow relations, and the prohibition on grid charging. R014's renewable charging compensation condition cannot replace the charging-source constraint.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R008","v141-c-R014"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C003","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C004","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e02","v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e15","v141-b-g02-e18","v141-b-g03-E07"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Have B/C supplement the supply-demand, trading, and charging-source objects and constraints of the same mechanism, or clarify the reuse scope permitted by the source; do not silently migrate M01 quantity objects to the central battery model."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G014","category":"math_incomplete","description":"R012 retains both a strict price ordering and a per-household discharge price composition relation, but there is not enough time-series and applicability information to prove that both hold simultaneously for all households and time steps.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R012","v141-c-R014"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R012::phi::v141-c-R012-C002","v141-c-R012::phi::v141-c-R012-C003","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e10","v141-b-g02-e17"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Clarify the applicable interval of the ordering and check whether the actual price inputs are compatible with the composition relation; do not add truncation, price adjustment, or extra parameter conditions on your own."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G015","category":"math_incomplete","description":"R014's discharge expression defines a tariff rather than an amount; P2P trading revenues and expenditures lack transaction-by-transaction definitions, and although wholesale price compensation has a textual description, it has no independent symbol binding. The omission of the internal P2P term in the community objective cannot be used to derive individual payment allocation.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R008","v141-c-R014"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C002","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C001","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C002","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e22","v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E11"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Distinguish the output scopes of tariff, compensation trigger, and amount settlement; if payment calculation is required, supplement the source-supported quantity, payee, and price bindings, and maintain the community accounting treatment of the internal P2P term."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G016","category":"ontology_extension","description":"Shared battery operation, access, and charging/discharging service prices are still expressed through the existing clearing, participation, pricing, and payment nodes; all four related storage proposals remain unapproved.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R008","v141-c-R010","v141-c-R012","v141-c-R014"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C003","v141-c-R010::phi::v141-c-R010-C002","v141-c-R012::phi::v141-c-R012-C003","v141-c-R014::phi::v141-c-R014-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-e02","v141-b-g01-e10","v141-b-g02-e15","v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E08"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g01-p01","v141-b-g01-p02","v141-b-g03-P01","v141-b-g03-P02"],"required_work":"Manually check the expression boundary between storage functions and P2P functions and handle pending proposals; this assembly does not add nodes or approve ontology changes."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-G017","category":"unverified_source","description":"All sources in this cluster remain unverified. Citation eligibility supports only experimental candidates and does not mean that the objective formulas, price indices, or central battery transcription have passed independent review.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R008","v141-c-R010","v141-c-R012","v141-c-R014"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-e14","v141-b-g02-e15","v141-b-g02-e17","v141-b-g03-E08","v141-b-g03-E11"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check all chains and mappings, prioritizing the objective formulas, price indices, central battery constraints, and source scope."}]},"rule_refs":["26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R008","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R012","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R014","26-battery_flexibility::v141-c-R010"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-79bf800032a75283","COMP-7f5e3dcddfa1014c","COMP-9ead8747bdf6fc35","COMP-c20e8384baea16b3","KG40-a4d1852d45e298e3"]});
